# Build context of deploy/Containerfile (Docker reads .dockerignore; Podman and Buildah read it
# too when there is no .containerignore). Keep build output, local secrets, backups and VCS data
# out. Patterns match from the context root (the repository), so every secret-bearing name is
# written with `**/` to match in deploy/ and anywhere else.
.git
.claude
**/target
fuzz/artifacts
fuzz/corpus
# Operator settings (profile C puts the database URL, with its password, in deploy/.env).
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/pg_password
# Databases, backups and secrets copies (docs/self-hosting.md §5, §8).
**/*.sqlite3*
**/*.age
**/*.gpg
**/rizzy-secrets*.json
deploy/backup
deploy/backup-db
deploy/backup-secrets
# JavaScript workspace: host-built dependencies and outputs. The image installs and builds its
# own (deploy/Containerfile stages `wasm` and `web`); a host's node_modules is for another OS.
**/node_modules
packages/core/generated
packages/*/dist
apps/web/dist
apps/web/test-results
apps/web/playwright-report
